<p>Bikhre pade hai laashe aulaade murtaza ke<br />
Zainab ujad gayi hai karbobala me aake</p>

<p>Paamaal kar diya hai lashkar ne jisme qaasim<br />
Shabbir chun rahe hai tukde aba bichaake</p>

<p>Haatho'n se dil ko thaame doude hai shaah ran ko<br />
Shaayad gire hai akber barchi jigar pa khaake</p>

<p>Abbas tum kahaa'n ko mazloom ko sambhaalo<br />
Shabbir thak chuke hai laashe utha utha ke</p>

<p>Bhoole gi kaise maadar asghar ka teer khaana<br />
chup chaap ro rahi hai jhoole se sar lagaake</p>

<p>dam todte hai asghar ae naama bar teherja<br />
ab kya milega tujh ko soughra ka khat sunaake<br />
